# Kept as a safety net only. The required-context drift check installs its one
# dependency into RUNNER_TEMP rather than the workspace (see
# .github/workflows/verify.yml), precisely so dependency READMEs never land in
# the link checker's './**/*.md' glob — this workflow's first real run failed on
# `node_modules/yaml/docs/CONTRIBUTING.md` and an npmjs.com 403, neither of
# which is this repository's content. If anyone ever runs a bare `npm install`
# here, this stops the same failure recurring.
node_modules/
